steps = PackedStringArray("Fill the saucepan with rainwater at the butt on deck.", "Boil it on the hearth (4s). Dice a tomato, chop an onion.", "Add both, boil (8s), and ladle it into a bowl.", "All in cold at once is quicker, and worse.")
